{"openapi":"3.1.0","info":{"title":"OpenAPI definition","version":"v0"},"servers":[{"url":"http://localhost:8081","description":"Generated server url"}],"paths":{"/api/auth/internal/user":{"post":{"tags":["internal-user-controller"],"summary":"Import internal user with roles","description":"### How to test this endpoint\n\nFor testing this internal user import, provide a new `telegram_user_id` and assign roles.\nReplace the values below with valid data.\n","operationId":"upsertUser","requestBody":{"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/UserUpsertRequestDto"},"examples":{"InternalUserRequestDto example":{"description":"InternalUserRequestDto example","value":{"telegram_user_id":6440401305,"roles":["ADMIN","STUDENT"]}}}}},"required":true},"responses":{"201":{"description":"User imported successfully."},"400":{"description":"Validation error or unknown role","content":{"*/*":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorResponseDto"}}}},"500":{"description":"Internal server error","content":{"*/*":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorResponseDto"}}}}}}},"/api/auth/by-telegram":{"post":{"tags":["auth-controller"],"summary":"Authenticate user via Telegram","description":"### How to test this endpoint\n\nFor successful authentication you must use **initData generated by your Telegram bot**.\nUse the bot token of the Telegram bot configured in your backend — Telegram will generate a valid `initData` string only for this bot.\n\n### Example of initData (JSON-like debug format)\n\n```text\nuser=%7B%22id%22%3A628570951%2C%22first_name%22%3A%22llqq%22...\n```\n\nReplace this value with the real initData from Telegram WebApp.\n","operationId":"authenticate","requestBody":{"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/TelegramAuthRequestDto"},"examples":{"Valid initData example":{"description":"Valid initData example","value":"<PASTE_YOUR_INITDATA_HERE>"}}}},"required":true},"responses":{"200":{"description":"Authenti